</label><p>AUC<sub>0&#x02013;inf</sub> PK parameter values were excluded from the summary statistics after not meeting &#x02265;1 of the following: terminal elimination rate constant was calculated with an adjusted correlation coefficient r<sup>2</sup> of &#x02265;0.85 and/or a %AUC<sub>extrap</sub>&#x02009;&#x02264;&#x02009;20%.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap position="float" id="bcp14850-tbl-0003" content-type="TABLE"><label>TABLE 3</label><caption><p>PK parameters for CT&#x02010;P17 AI and CT&#x02010;P17 PFS (PK population<xref rid="bcp14850-note-0009" ref-type="table-fn">
<sup>a</sup>
</xref>)</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><col align="left" span="1"/><col align="left" span="1"/><col align="left" span="1"/><thead valign="bottom"><tr style="border-bottom:solid 1px #000000"><th align="left" valign="bottom" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Parameter (units)</th><th align="left" valign="bottom" rowspan="1" colspan="1">CT&#x02010;P17 AI (<italic toggle="no">n</italic>&#x02009;=&#x02009;84)</th><th align="left" valign="bottom" rowspan="1" colspan="1">CT&#x02010;P17 PFS (<italic toggle="no">n</italic>&#x02009;=&#x02009;80)</th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" colspan="3" valign="top" rowspan="1">T<sub>max</sub> (h)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="padding-left:10%" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
